g those crucial nano boosts to help  turn the tides Joey folks in play is on  ax currently still in beta but how can  they do it well currently she's only  available on PC and if you want to play  as her just load up the ballon it  launcher choose PTR under your location  and just jump right in and good luck to  you for more tips on all the overwatch  heroes be sure to check out our  overwatch hero guide playlist right here  on YouTube and on GameSpot
 

